From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:29:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Name the firmware ouroBIOS

The firmware of this payload is ouroBIOS: set the name the LVGL setup
shows next to its logo in the menu bar (PcdLvglAptioHeaderVendor) and
the vendor of the UEFI system table (PcdFirmwareVendor, "EDK II" by
default; Linux prints it at boot, "efi: EFI v2.x by ouroBIOS").

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
index 66d9a81d5f..9809c89e14 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dsc
@@ -773,6 +773,7 @@
 
 [PcdsFixedAtBuild]
   gEfiMdePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdHardwareErrorRecordLevel|1
+  gEfiMdeModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdFirmwareVendor|L"ouroBIOS"
   gEfiMdeModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdMaxVariableSize|0x8000
   gEfiMdeModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdMaxHardwareErrorVariableSize|0x8000
   gEfiMdeModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdVariableStoreSize|0x10000
@@ -793,7 +794,7 @@
   #
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglHelpPaneWidthPct|25
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglAptioHeaderTitle|"System Preferences"
-  gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglAptioHeaderVendor|""
+  gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglAptioHeaderVendor|"ouroBIOS"
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglCenteredFrameEnabled|TRUE
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglCenteredFrameHeightPct|90
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglCenteredFrameAspectNum|16
